      "id": 109,
      "message": "Dear J & J,\n\nWe have watched you two grow together over so many years, through moves and new jobs and the great sourdough phase of 2020. Seeing you stand up there today, so obviously right for each other, was one of the happiest moments we have had in a long time.\n\nHere is our advice, for what it is worth: keep laughing at the same dumb things. Keep a running list of places you want to go and actually go to one every year. Say thank you for the small stuff.\n\nAll our love, always.",
      "author_name": "The Abernathy-Nguyen Family",
      "author_trusted": false,
      "status": "approved",
      "created_at": "2026-04-28 03:36:00",
      "is_own": false,
